n\">Build Browser, Linux and Windows AI agents in seconds.</div>\n   597→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   598→                        <span class=\"source\">Product Hunt</span> · <span class=\"published-date\">2026-05-14</span>\n   599→                    </div>\n   600→                </div>\n   601→\n   602→                <div class=\"item\">\n   603→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   604→                        <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/open-browser\" target=\"_blank\">Open Browser</a>\n   605→                        <span class=\"category\">open-source tool</span>\n   606→                    </div>\n   607→                    <div class=\"item-description\">Open-source browser automation for local AI agents.</div>\n   608→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   609→                        <span class=\"source\">Product Hunt</span> · <span class=\"published-date\">2026-05-14</span>\n   610→                    </div>\n   611→                </div>\n   612→\n   613→                <div class=\"item\">\n   614→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   615→                        <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/hopper\" target=\"_blank\">Hopper</a>\n   616→                        <span class=\"category\">specialized IDE</span>\n   617→                    </div>\n   618→                    <div class=\"item-description\">First agentic development environment for mainframe/COBOL.</div>\n   619→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   620→                        <span class=\"source\">Product Hunt</span> · <span class=\"published-date\">2026-05-12</span>\n   621→                    </div>\n   622→                </div>\n   623→            </section>\n   624→\n   625→            <!-- Whitelist Updates Section -->\n   626→            <section class=\"whitelist-updates\" id=\"whitelist-updates\">\n   627→                <h2>Whitelist Updates (0)</h2>\n   628→                <div cla