.com/posts/google-antigravity-cli\" target=\"_blank\">Google Antigravity CLI</a></div>\n   432→                <div class=\"description\">Run coding agents directly from your terminal with CLI interface that supports SSH workflows and remote server development.</div>\n   433→                <div class=\"meta\">\n   434→                    <span class=\"category\">AI coding CLI</span>\n   435→                    <span class=\"source\">Product Hunt</span>\n   436→                </div>\n   437→                <div class=\"community-quotes\">\n   438→                    <div class=\"quote\">\"The SSH workflow is a game changer - I can now work on remote servers seamlessly\"</div>\n   439→                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Finally a CLI tool that doesn't try to be everything - focused on terminal workflows\"</div>\n   440→                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Running parallel agents on isolated worktrees is brilliant for testing features\"</div>\n   441→                </div>\n   442→            </div>\n   443→\n   444→            <div class=\"product-item\">\n   445→                <div class=\"title\"><a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/shioricode\" target=\"_blank\">ShioriCode</a></div>\n   446→                <div class=\"description\">Open-source alternative to Codex & Claude Code for AI-assisted development that provides a full coding agent experience.</div>\n   447→                <div class=\"meta\">\n   448→                    <span class=\"category\">open-source coding agent</span>\n   449→                    <span class=\"source\">Product Hunt</span>\n   450→                </div>\n   451→            </div>\n   452→\n   453→            <div class=\"product-item\">\n   454→                <div class=\"title\"><a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/cline-sdk\" target=\"_blank\">Cline SDK</a></div>\n   455→                <div class=\"description\">Build coding agents with a plugin-based open-source runtime for extensible AI development workflows.</div>\n   456→                <div class=\"meta\">\n   457→                    <span class=\"category\">open-source coding agent</span>\n   458→                    <span class=\"source\">Product Hunt</span>\n   459→                </div>\n   460→            </div>\n   461→\n   462→            <div class=\"product-item\">\n   463→                <div class=\"title\"><a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/runtime\" target=\"_blank\">Runtime</a></div>\n   464→                <div class=\"description\">Sandboxed coding agents for everyone on your team with Slack integration for collaborative AI development.</div>\n   465→                <div class=\"meta\">\n   466→                    <span class=\"category\">open-source coding agent</span>\n   467→                    <span class=\"source\">Product Hunt</span>\n   468→                </div>\n   469→            </div>\n   470→\n   471→            <div class=\"product-item\">\n   472→                <div class=\"title\"><a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/vibedock\" target=\"_blank\">Vibedock</a></div>\n   473→                <div class=\"description\">Toggle Claude Code MCP servers from your menu bar for seamless IDE integration and server management.</div>\n   474→                <div class=\"meta\">\n   475→                    <span class=\"category\">IDE integration</span>\n   476→                    <span class=\"source\">Product Hunt</span>\n   477→                </div>\n   478→            </div>\n   479→\n   480→            <div class=\"product-item\">\n   481→                <div class=\"title\"><a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/allihat\" target=\"_blank\">AlliHat</a></div>\n   482→                <div class=\"description\">Claude AI integrated in your Safari sidebar for browser-based coding with contextual assistance.</div>\n   483→                <div class=\"meta\">\n   484→                    <span class=\"category\">IDE integration</span>\n   485→                    <span c